This integration retains this project's native motion observations, goals,
dynamics, reward, critic, and optimization schedule. Velocity-only observations
use proprioception with constant padding instead of the motion-reference rot6d.
The centered velocity mean is clamped per clip, avoiding upstream's documented
cross-clip averaging at concatenated boundaries. Human training and optional
teleoperation modules are not imported by this independent task.
